<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">Mark</book>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="mt">Mark</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian Fapa Isua Krista Chanchin Ṭha thlen ṭan tirhna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabuah, “Ngai teh, ka tirhkoh i hmaah ka tîr a, Ani chuan i kawng a siam ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thlalêra mi au râwl chuan, ‘Lalpa lamlian sial ula, a kawngte tingîl rawh u,’ a ti,” tia ziak ang khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johana, thlalêra baptistu kha, thil tihsual ngaihdam nân simna baptisma thu hrilin a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Judai rama mi zawng zawng leh Jerusalem khuaa mi zawng zawngte an chhuak a, a hnên lamah an kal a, an sualte thupha chawiin Jordan luiah chuan a hnênah baptisma an chang ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Johana chu sanghâwngsei hmul puanin a inthuam a, a kâwng chu savun kâwnghrênin a hrêng a, a chaw chu khaukhuap leh ram khawizu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, “Ka hnungah keimah aia ropui zâwk a lo kal mêk a ni; kûna a pheikhawk hrui phelh tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei zawngin tuiin ka baptis ṭhîn che u a; ani erawh chuan Thlarau Thianghlimin a baptis ang che u,” tiin a hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chûng nîahte chuan heti hi a lo ni a, Isua chu Galili rama Nazareth khua aṭangin a lo kal a, Jordan luiah chuan Johana hnênah baptisma a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu veleh tui ata a chhuahin, vân inhawnga Thlarau ṭhuro anga a chunga lo chhuk a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, “Nang, ka Fapa duh tak i ni a, i chungah ka lâwm êm êm a ni,” tiin vân aṭangin aw a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Thlarau chuan ani chu thlalêrah a tîr chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Setana thlêm chungin thlalêrah chuan ni sawmli a awm a, ramsa zîngahte a awm a; vântirhkohte chuan a rawng an bâwlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Johana an man hnuin, Isua chu Pathian Chanchin Ṭha hrilin Galili ramah a lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hun chu a lo thleng ta a, Pathian ram pawh a lo hnai ta; sim ula, Chanchin Ṭha hi ring rawh u,” a ti zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Galili dîl kam chu a hrût laiin, Simona leh Simona unau Andria chu dîlah chuan lên dêngin a hmu a; sangha mantu an ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Mi zui rawh u; tichuan, mihring mantuah ka siam ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lênte chu kalsanin an zui ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, thui lo tê a kalin, Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh a unau Johana chu a hmu a, chu mite chu lên siam ṭhain lawngah bawk an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan anni chu a ko ta nghâl a; tichuan, an pa Zebedaia chu inhlawhfa an rawihte hnênah chuan lawngah an kalsan a, an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Kapernaum khuaah an va lût a; tin, Chawlhniah chuan inkhâwmna inah a lût a, a zirtîr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thu zirtîr chu mak an ti hle a; lehkhaziaktute ang lova, thuneihna nei âwm taka anmahni a zirtîr avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, an inkhâwmna inah chuan ramhuai bawlhhlawh pai mi pakhat a lo awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ani chu, “Nazareth Isu, keini leh nang eng nge kan inzâwlna awm? Min tiboral tûrin i lo kal em ni? Nang ka hria a che, Pathian mi thianghlim i ni e,” tiin a au chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hau va, “Ngawi la, a chhûng ata lo chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ramhuai bawlhhlawh chu amah sawisaa ring taka auvin, a chhûng ata a lo chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, an zain mak an ti êm êm a; chutichuan, “Hei hi eng nge ni le? Zirtîrna thar a nih hi le! Ramhuai bawlhhlawhte pawh thunei takin thu a pe a, a thu an âwih zêl hi le,” tiin an inhnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Galili ram vêl zawng zawnga ram tinah a chanchin chu a thang ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna in ata chu an chhuahin, Jakoba leh Johana nên Simona leh Andria inah chuan an lût ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Simona nupuia nu chu khawsikin a nâ a, a lo mu a; tichuan, a chanchin chu Isua an hrilh ta nghâl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tin, ani chuan a kut a va chelh a, a kai tho ta a; tichuan, a khawsik chu a reh a, an rawng a bâwlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, tlai lamah ni a tlâk hnu chuan, damlo zawng zawng leh ramhuai mante a hnênah an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A khuain kawngkhâr bulah chuan an lo awm khâwm ta mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, mi tam tak nat tinrênga nâte chu a tidam a, ramhuai tam tak a hnawt chhuak bawk a; ramhuaite chuan amah chu an hriat avângin an ṭawng a phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, zîngah khawvâr hma daihin a tho va, a chhuak a, thlalêr hmunah a va kal a, chutah chuan a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Simona leh a ṭhiante chuan an va zawng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />tin, ani chu an va hmuh chuan a hnênah, “Mi zawng zawngin an zawng che asin le,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hêng lai vêla khaw dangahte huan i kal ang u, chûngahte pawh chuan thu ka hril theihna tûrin; chu chu ka lo kal chhan a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tichuan, thu hrila ramhuaite hnawt chhuak zêlin, Galili ram zawng zawnga an inkhâwmna inahte a lût zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah phâr a lo kal a, “I duh chuan mi tithianghlim thei e,” tiin a hmaah ṭhingṭhiin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a lo khawngaih êm êm a, a han ban a, a dek a, “Ka duh e, lo thianghlim tawh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tichuan, chawplehchilhin a phâr chu a lo reh ta nghâl a, a lo thianghlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Isua chuan, “Tu ma hnêna eng mah sawi lo tûrin fîmkhur ang che; amaherawhchu, puithiam hnênah va inentîr la, i inthen nân Mosian thil a ruatte kha hlân rawh, an hriat fiahna tûrin,” a ti tlat a, a kaltîr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu a chhuak a, chu mi chanchin chu nasa taka tlângaupuiin a puang darh ta a; chutichuan, Isua chu a langin khuaah a lût thei ta lo va, thlalêr hmunahte a awm ta zâwk a; tin, hmun tin ata a hnênah an lo kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni eng emaw zât hnuah Kapernaum khuaa a luh lehin, inah chuan a awm tih thu a lo thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, kawngka bulah pawh awmna rêng awm lo khawp hialin mi tam tak an lo awm khâwm ta a; tin, an hnênah thu a hril ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, zeng pakhat, mi paliina zâwn a hnênah an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, mipui avânga a kiang hnaia an lo kal theih loh avângin, a awmna in chung chu an ṭhiat a; tin, an reh pawh zawhin, a âwngphah chu a chunga mi zeng mu chawp chuan an zuk thlâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan an rinzia chu a lo hmuhin zeng hnênah chuan, “Ka fa, i sualte ngaihdam a ni tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktu ṭhenkhatte chu chutah chuan an ṭhu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“He mi hian engati nge hetiang thu hi a sawi ni? Pathian a sawi chhia a nih hi; mi pakhat, Pathian chauh lo chuan, tuin nge sualte ngaidam thei ni?” tiin an thinlungin an ngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an rilruin chutiangin an ngaihtuah tih a rilruin a lo hre ta nghâl a, an hnênah, “Chûng thu chu engati nge in thinlunga in ngaihtuah ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zeng hnênah hian, ‘I sualte ngaihdam a ni tawh,’ tih leh, ‘Tho la, i âwngphah la la, kein kal tawh rawh,’ tih hi a eng nge sawi awl zâwk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, khawvêlah Mihring Fapain sual ngaihdam theihna a nei tih in hriat nân, (zeng hnênah chuan)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tho la, i âwngphah la la, i inah kal rawh, ka ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu a tho va, a âwngphah chu a la ta nghâl a, an zaa hmuhah chuan a kal chhuak ta a; chutichuan, an zain mak an ti hle a, “Hetiang rêng rêng hi kan la hmu ngai lo,” tiin Pathian an fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a chhuak leh a, dîl kamah chuan a kal ta a; tin, mipui zawng zawng chu a hnênah an va kal a, a lo zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a kal pahin Levia, Alphaia fapa chu chhiah chawina hmuna ṭhu a hmu a, a hnênah, “Mi rawn zui rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a tho va, a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isua chuan Levia inah chuan chaw a kîl a, chhiahkhawntute leh mi sual tam takin Isua leh a zirtîrte chu an kîlpui hlawm a: an tam hle si a, amah chu an zui ve bawk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite zînga lehkhaziaktute chuan, Isuan mi sual leh chhiahkhawntute a kîlpui an hmuhin, a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Engtizia nge chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte hnênah a eia a in le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chu chu a lo hria a, an hnênah chuan, “Mi chakte chuan dâktawr an ngai lo va, mi bawrhsâwmte zâwkin an ngai a ni; mi fel takte lam tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, mi sualte zâwk lam tûra lo kal ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Johana zirtîrte leh Pharisaite chuan chaw an nghei a; tin, mi an lo kal a, Isua hnênah chuan, “Engati nge Johana zirtîrte leh Pharisai zirtîrten chaw an nghei ṭhina, i zirtîrte lêmin an nghei ve ṭhin loh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Mo hruaitute hnênah a pasal tûr chu a awm chhûng zawng, mo hruaitute chuan chaw an nghei thei em ni? A pasal tûr chu an hnêna a awm chhûng zawng an nghei thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, a pasal tûr chu an hnên ata hruai bo nite a la thleng ang a, chumi nîah erawh chuan an la nghei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tu mân puan hlui, puan la thlâk mar loh themin an bel ngai lo; bel ang sela, a bel phuina tûr chuan a kai ṭet zâwk ang a, a thar chuan a hlui chu a kai ṭêt ang a, a lo thlêr nasa lehzual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, tu mân uain thar, savun uain peng hluiahte an thun ngai lo; thun ang sela, uain chuan savun pengte chu a tâwn puak ang a, uain leh savun pengte chu a boral ve ve ang; uain thar chu savun uain peng tharahte an thun zâwk ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isua chu Chawlhniah chuan buh hmunahte a kal tlang a; tin, a zirtîrte chuan an kal pahin buh vuite chu an thliak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite chuan a hnênah, “En teh, engati nge Chawlhnia tih thiang lo chu an tih ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Davida leh a ṭhiante an tlâkchhama, an rilṭâm laia a thiltih kha in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khatia Abiathara puithiam lalber a nih laia, Pathian ina a luha, puithiamte chauh lo chuan ei thian loh chhangdah chu a eia, a ṭhiante hnêna a pêk ve thu kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah chuan, “Chawlhni hi mihring tâna siam a ni a, mihring hi Chawlhni tâna siam a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />chutichuan, Mihring Fapa hi Chawlhni chungah lam pawh hian lal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna inah chuan a lût leh a; chutah chuan mi pakhat kut zeng a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, amah an hêk theih nân Chawlhniah a tihdam dâwn leh dâwn loh an mitmei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, anin kut zeng hnênah chuan, “Lo ding chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan, “Chawlhniah hian tihṭhat nge thiang tihchhiat? Chhandam nge thiang tihhlum?” tiin a zâwt a. Nimahsela, an ngawi ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, an thinlung sak chu pawi ti êm êmin, thinur chunga anmahni a en vêl hnuin, chu mi hnênah chuan, “I kut phar rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a han phar chhuak a, a kut chu a dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite chu an chhuak a, amah an tihhlum theih dan tûr ngaihtuahin Heroda pâwla mite nên chuan an inrâwn ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a zirtîrte nên dîl lamah chuan an kal bo va; tin, Galili ram aṭangin mipui tam takin an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a thiltih ropuizia chu an hriatin Judai ram aṭang te, Jerusalem khua aṭang te, Idumai ram aṭang te, Jordan râl aṭang te, Tura leh Sidon khaw vêl aṭang tein mipui tam tak a hnênah an lo kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, mipui avâng chuan a tân lawnglêng lo ruatsak tûrin a zirtîrte a hrilh a, “Chuti lo chuan, mi nêk huai huai dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tam tak a tidam tawh si a; chutichuan, na nei apiangin amah an deh theihna tûrin an bawh huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ramhuai bawlhhlawhte pawhin amah chu an hmuh apiangin a hmaah bawkkhupin, “Nang Pathian Fapa chu i ni,” tiin an au ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chanchin chu puan loh tûr an hnênah a ti tlat zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, tlângah chuan a han kal a, amahin a duh zâwng apiangte chu a ko va; tin, anni chu a hnênah an han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a hnêna an awm theih nân leh, thu hril tûr leh ramhuaite hnawh chhuahna thu nei tûra a tirh chhuah theih nân, sâwm leh pahnih a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûngte chu Simona, Petera a vuah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh Jakoba unau Johana-te (chu mite chu “Boanergea” a vuah a, chu chu “Khawpuiri Fate” tihna a ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Andria te, Philipa te, Bartholomaia te, Matthaia te, Thoma te, Alphaia fapa Jakoba te, Thaddaia te, Kanaan-a mi Simona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a mantîrtu Juda Iskariota te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, inah a va lût a. Tin, mipui chu an lo kal khâwm leh a; chutichuan, chhang takngial pawh an ei thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a chhûngte chuan chu chu an hriatin, “A â a nih chu le,” tiin amah man tumin an thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua aṭanga lehkhaziaktute lo chhuk chuan, “Beelzebula a zâwl a nih hi,” an ti a. “Ramhuai lal avângin alâwm ramhuaite a hnawh chhuah ṭhin ni,” an ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isua chuan lehkhaziaktute chu a ko va, tehkhin thuin an hnênah, “Setanan Setana vêk engtin nge a hnawh chhuah theih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram pawh mahni a indo chuan, chumi ram chu a ding chhuak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chhûngkhat pawh mahni an indo chuan, chu mite chhûng chu an ding chhuak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Setana pawh mahni indova a inkhin si chuan a ding chhuak thei lo vang a, a boral mai zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu mân mi chak ina lûtin a sum chu an lâksak thei ṭhîn lo, mi chak chu an phuar hmasak zet loh chuan; chumi hnuah erawh chuan a in chu an ramsak mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, mihring fate hi an sualna zawng zawngah leh Pathian an sawichhiatna kawng engah pawh, an sawichhiatnaahte chuan ngaihdam an ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tu pawh Thlarau Thianghlim meuh sawi chhia erawh chuan eng tikah mah ngaihdamna a hmu lo vang a, chatuan sualna kawngah chuan thiam lohvin a awm zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />(“Ramhuai bawlhhlawh a zâwl a ni,” an tih avâng khân chu chu a sawi a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, a nu leh a unaute chu an lo kal a, pâwnah an ding a, amah kovah mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a vêlah chuan mipui an lo ṭhu hlawm a; tin, a hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, pâwnah sâwn i nu leh i unauten an zawng a che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka nu leh ka unaute chu tute nge ni?” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a kiang vêla ṭhute chu a han en vêl a, “En teh u, ka nu leh ka unaute hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tu pawh Pathian duh zâwng ti apiang chu, chu mite ngei chu ka unaute, ka farnute, ka nute an ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, dîl kamah chuan a zirtîr leh ta a. Tin, mipui tam tak mai a hnênah an rawn inkhâwm a; chutichuan, dîlah chuan lawngah a chuang a, a ṭhu a; mipuiho zawng zawng chu dîl kama khawmualah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, tehkhin thuin thu tam tak a zirtîr a; a zirtîrnaah chuan an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ngaithla ula, en teh u; buh chi thehtu buh chi thehin a feh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tin, heti hi a lo ni a, a theh laiin a ṭhen kalkawng dungah a tla a, savaten an rawn tlân zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen pialtlêp chung lei pan hmunah a tla a; lei a chhah loh avangin a ṭo ta nghâl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nimahsela, ni a lo tlângsân deuhvin em vuaiin a lo awm a, zung a neih loh avângin a râwp ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen hnimhlîngnei zîngah a tla a, hnim chu a lo ṭo sâng a, a dîp ral ta a, rah rêng rêng a rah ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen lei ṭhaah a tla a, a ṭo va, a ṭhang lian a, a rah ta a; sawmthum te, sawmruk te, za tein a pung ta hlawm a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin, “Tu pawh hriatna tûra beng nei chuan hre rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, fianriala a awm laiin sâwm leh pahnihte leh a ṭhuihruai dangte chuan tehkhin thute chu an zâwt fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Pathian ram thurûk chu nangni hriat zawng phal a ni a, pâwna mite tân erawh chuan engkim tehkhin thûa tih a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chutichuan, ‘Hmuh zawng an hmu thei na a, hriat erawh chu an hriat theih lohna tûr leh, beng zawngin an hre thei na a, a ngaihna erawh chu an hriat theih lohna tûrin; chuti lo chuan, an hawi kîr leh ang a, ngaihdam an lo ni hlauh dah ang e,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah chuan, “He tehkhin thu hi in hre thei lo maw? Chuti a nih chuan, engtin nge tehkhin thu dang zawng zawngte chu in hriat hleih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Buh chi thehtu chuan thu chu a theh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, kawng dunga thu thehnate chu hêng hi an ni: thu an hriat veleh Setana chuan an rilrua thu theh chu a lâksak nghâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, chutiang bawkin pialtlêp chunga theh chu hêng hi an ni: thu an hriat veleh lâwm taka pawm nghâlte hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />nimahsela, anmahniah chuan zung rêng an nei lo va, rei lo tê chauh an awm a; chumi hnuah chuan thu avânga hrehawmna emaw, tihduhdahna emaw a lo awm veleh an tlu nghâl mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, mi dangte chu hnimhlîngnei zînga theh chu an ni a; chûngte chuan thu chu an hre tawh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nimahsela, khawvêl lungkhamnate, hausakna bumnate, thil dang châknate chu a lo luhin, thu chu a dîp a, rah lovin a lo awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, lei ṭhaa theh chu hêng hi an ni: thu chu hriaa, pawma, a leh sawmthum te, a leh sawmruk te, a leh za tea rahte hi an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah chuan, “Khâwnvâr chu a dahnaa dah lova, hrai hnuaiah emaw, khum hnuaiah emaw dah tûrin an rawn la ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Puan loh tûra zêp eng mah a awm lo va, lang lo tûra thuhrûk eng mah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawhin hriatna tûra beng an neih chuan hre rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah chuan, “In ngaihthlâk chu eng nge a nih fîmkhur rawh u; in tehna ngai bawkin an tehsak ang che u a, an pe tam zâwk mah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu pawh a nei chu an pêk belhchhah ang a; tu pawh a nei lo chu a neih chhun pawh an lâksak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin, “Pathian ram chu hetiang hi a ni; miin leiah hian chi theh sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />zânah muhîlin chhûnah tho ṭhîn sela, chi chu, a zia a hriat lohvin lo ṭiakin lo ṭhang sela; chutiang chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lei hian amahin rah a rawn chhuah ṭhîn; a tîr berah a kûng, chumi hnuah chuan a vui; tin, chumi hnu lehah a vuiah chuan buh fang pum chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, rah chu a lo hmin hunin, buh lâk a lo hun tâk avângin favah chu a phawrh nghâl ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin, “Pathian ram chu engtin nge kan tehkhin ang? A nih loh leh, eng tehkhin thuin nge kan tehkhin ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anṭam chi fang khat leia an thehin, leia chi zawng zawng aiin tê ber mah sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a theh hnuah erawh chuan a lo ṭiak a, thlai zawng zawng aiin a lo lian ta zâwk a, zâr lian tak takte a lo nei a; chutichuan, chunglêng savate chu a bukah chuan an riak thei ṭhîn; chutiang chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chutiang tehkhin thu tam tak chuan an hriat theih tâwk tâwkin thu chu an hnênah a sawi ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, tehkhin thu lovin an hnênah thu a sawi ngai lo; a zirtîrte hnênah erawh chuan fianrialah engkim a hrilhfiah ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni vêkah chuan, khua a lo tlai lamin ani chuan an hnênah, “Râl lehlamah sâwn i kai ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tichuan, mipuite chu kalsanin, amah chu a awm pângngai ang chuan lawngah chuan an kalpui ta nghâl a. Lawng dangte pawh a hnênah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, thlipui nasa tak a lo tleh a, tuifâwnte chu lawngah chuan a fâwn lût hlawp hlawp a; chutichuan, lawng chu a lo khat dâwn ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ani chu lukham chu khama muhîlin, lawng mei lamah chuan a awm a. Tin, an kai tho va, a hnênah chuan, “Zirtîrtu, kan boral hi pawi i ti lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a lo harh a, thli chu a hau va, dîl hnênah pawh chuan, “Ngawi la, awm hle hle rawh!” a ti a. Tin, thli chu a bâng a, a lo reh ta ṭhuap mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Engati nge chuti êma in hlauh ni le? Rinna rêng in la nei lo a ni maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, hlauh namênin an hlau ta lo va, “He mi hi tu nge ni le, thli leh dîl lam pawhin a thu an âwih hi?” an ti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, dîl râl, Gerasin mite ram chu an lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lawng ata a chhuah hnu chuan mi pakhat, ramhuai bawlhhlawh pai, thlân aṭanga lo chhuakin a rawn tâwk ta nghâl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu mi chuan thlânahte chuan awmna a nei ṭhîn a, tu mahin khaidiat pawhin an phuar thei tawh lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />kawlte leh khaidiatte pawhin an phuar fo tawh si a; nimahsela, khaidiatte chu a pawt chat a, kawlte pawh chu a tisawm ṭhîn a; tu mahin an tidawl zo hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chhûn a zânin thlânahte leh tlângahte chuan a au a au ṭhîn a, lungte pawhin a inzai fo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hla tak aṭangin Isua chu a hmuh veleh a tlân a, chibai a va bûk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, aw ring taka auvin, “Isu, Pathian Chungnungbera Fapa, kei leh nang eng nge kan inzâwlna awm? Mi nghaisa lul lo tûrin Pathian hmingin ka ngên chiam a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Isua chuan a hnênah, “Nang, ramhuai bawlhhlawhpa, mihring chhûng ata hi chhuak rawh,” a lo ti tawh si a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “I hming eng nge ni?” tiin a zâwt a. Tin, anin a hnênah, “Ka hming chu Nuaia a ni, tam tak kan ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chumi ram ata chu anmahni tîr chhuak lo tûrin Isua hnênah a ngên ta chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chuta tlâng pangah chuan vawk rual tam tak an tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ramhuai bawlhhlawhte chuan, “Vawk kawchhûngahte sâwn min luhtîr rawh, anmahnia kan luh theih nân,” tiin a hnênah an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan thu a pe a. Tichuan, ramhuai bawlhhlawhte chu an chhuak a, vawk kawchhûngahte chuan an lût a; tichuan, vawk rual chu (sânghnih lai an ni a) khâmah an tlân chhuk chiam a, dîlah an tlân lût ta a; tin, dîlah chuan tui hâkin an thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a vulhtute chu an tlân a, khuaah leh lovahte chuan an sawi a. Tin, “Eng nge lo ni ta?” tia en tûrin an lo kal hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Isua hnên an lo thleng a, ramhuai man, Nuaia mana kha, puan sina, rilru pângngai pua ṭhu an rawn hmu a; tichuan, an hlau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a hretute chuan ramhuai mana chunga thil thlenzia leh, vawk chanchinte chu chûnghote chu an lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chûnghote chuan ani chu an ram ata chhuak tûrin an ngên ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lawnga a chuan dâwn lai takin, ramhuai man hnua khân Isua hnêna awm reng a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan a phal lo va, a hnênah, “I inah i ṭhiante hnênah haw la, Lalpan i tân thil a tihsak che hi a ropuizia leh a khawngaihzia che hi va hrilh rawh,” a ti ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, a kal a, Dekapoli khuaahte chuan Isuan a tân thil a tihsak ropuizia chu a tlângaupui ta a; tin, mi zawng zawng chuan mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu lawnga râl lehlama a lo kai leh chuan, mipui tam tak a hnênah an lo kal khâwm a; tin, ani chu dîl kamah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna in hotute zînga mi pakhat, a hming Jaira chu a lo kal a; Isua a hmuh veleh a ke bulah a bawkkhup a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka fanu naupang tê a thi lek lek a; a lo harha a lo dam theih nân, lo kala a chunga i kut nghat tûrin ka ngên a che,” tiin a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu a hnênah a va kal a; tin, mipui tam takin an zui a, an nêk huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe pakhat, kum sâwm leh kum hnih thi pûtin a damlo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />dâktawr tam tak lakah nasa takin a tuar tawh a, a neih zawng zawng pawh a dek ral zo tawh a, ṭhathnem ahnêkin a lo zual zâwk mah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Isua chanchin thute chu a lo hria a, a hnunga mipui zîngah chuan a lo kal a, a puan chu a dek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“A puan chauh pawh dek ila, tihdamin ka awm mai ang,” a tirilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, chawplehchilhin a thi pût chu a lo reh ta nghâl a, a nâ chu tihdam a ni tih a taksaah a inhre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Isua chuan a chhûng ata thiltihtheihna chhuak ṭhîn chu a chhuak tih a lo hria a, mipui zîngah chuan a hawi vêl ta nghâl a, “Tu nge ka puante dek kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Mipuiin an nêk huai huai che hi i hmu si a, ‘Tu nge mi dek?’ engtiziaa ti nge i nih le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan chu mi titu chu hmuh tumin a en vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhia chuan a chunga thil a tihsak chu hriain, hlau leh khûr chungin a lo kal a, a hmaah a bawkkhup a, a hnênah thu dik tak a hrilh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka fanu, i rinna hi i dampui a ni e, thlamuang takin kal la, i natna ata chu lo dam hlen tawh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A la ṭawng lai mêkin inkhâwmna in hotu in ata chu mi an lo kal a, “I fanu a thi ta; engah nge zirtîrtu hi i la tihhah cheu dâwn?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan an thusawi chu bengkhawn lovin, inkhâwmna in hotu hnênah chuan, “Hlau suh, ring mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Petera te, Jakoba te, Jakoba unau Johana te chauh lo chu tu mah amah zui ve a phal ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna in hotu in chu a va thleng a, Isua chuan an lo buai mur mur leh an lo ṭap tuar tuara, an lo chiau vak vak chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a va luh chuan an hnênah, “Engati nge in bengchhena in ṭah ni? Naupang chu a thi lo ve, a muhîl a ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an nuihsan ta mai a. Ani erawh chuan an zain a hnawt chhuak a, naupang nu leh pa leh a hnêna awmte chu a hruai a, naupang awmnaah chuan a va lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, naupang kut chu a chelh a, a hnênah chuan, “Talitha Kumi!” a ti a (chu chu, “Chêmtê, tho rawh, ka ti a che,” tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe naupang chu a lo tho va, a kal thei ta nghâl a; amah chu kum sâwm leh kum hnih mi a ni tawh rêng a. Tin, anni chuan mak tih namênin mak an ti lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, anin an hnênah, “Hei hi tu mân hre suh se,” a ti tlat a; tin, ei tûr pêk tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chuta ta chu a chhuak a, a awmna khaw lam chu a thleng ta a; a zirtîrte chuan an zui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhni a lo ni a, inkhâwmna inah a zirtîr ta a; tin, mi tam tak a thu hriate chuan, “He mi hian hêng thute hi khawi ata nge a hriat ni? He mi hnêna finna pêk hi eng finna nge ni? A kutin heti kauva thilmak a tih hi eng tizia nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He mi hi Mari fapa, Jakoba te, Josea te, Juda te, Simona te unaupa, thingrem siamtu kha a ni lo vem ni? A farnute pawh hetah kan hnêna awm an ni lo vem ni?” an ti a, mak an ti hle a. Tichuan, a chungah an lungni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Zâwlnei chu ama khaw lamah te, ama laichîn zîngah te, ama inah te chauh lo chuan chawimawi lohvin a awm ngai lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mi damlo tlêm te chunga kut nghata a tihdam chauh lo chu, chutah chuan thilmak rêng a ti thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An rin loh avângin mak a ti hle a. Tin, zirtîr chung zêlin khuate chu a fang vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, sâwm leh pahnihte chu a ko va, pahnih zêlin a tîr chhuak ta a; ramhuai bawlhhlawhte chunga thuneihna a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an zinna atân tiang chauh lo chu eng mah - chhang pawh, iptê pawh, an kâwnghrêna tangka pawh - ken loh tûr a ti tlat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />pheikhawk erawh chu bun tûr a ti a; “Kawr pahnih ha suh u,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah, “Khawiah pawh in thlenna inah chuan, chuta ta in chhuah hma loh chu thleng reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, khawii khua pawhin an lawm loh che ua, in thu an ngaihthlâk lohna apiangah, chuta ṭanga in chhuah hun chuan, anmahni hriattîrna tûrin, in kephah hnuaia vaivut kai chu thing thla ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, an kal chhuak a, simna tûr thu an hril a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ramhuai tam tak an hnawt chhuak a; Tin damlo tam tak chu hriak an hnawih a, an tidam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lal Heroda chuan a lo hria a, a hming chu a lo thang ta si a; “Baptistu Johana kha mitthi zîng ata a lo tho leh ta a; chuvângin, chûng thiltihtheihnate chuan amahah a thawk a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi dang erawh chuan, “Elija a nih chu,” an ti a; mi dangin, “Zâwlnei a nih chu, zâwlneite zînga pakhat ang kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Heroda erawh chuan a lo hriatin, “Johana, a lû ka tana ngei kha, a lo tho leh ta a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heroda ngei chuan a unau Philipa nupui Herodi avângin mi a tîr chhuak a, Johana chu a mantîr a, tân inah phuar chungin a lo khung tawh si a; Herodi chu nupuiah a lo nei tawh si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Johana chuan Heroda hnênah, “I unau nupui i neihsak hi a thiang lo a ni,” a lo ti tawh bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Herodi chuan amah chu a hal riau va, tihhlum a châk a; nimahsela, a thei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Herodan Johana chu mi fel leh thianghlim tak a ni tih a hriat avângin amah chu a hlau va, a humhim tlat si a; a thu a ngaihthlâk chuan a mangang hle ṭhîn a; nimahsela, lâwm takin a ngaithla si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Herodan a pian champhaphâk nîah chuan a mi ropuite, sipai hotu lianhote, Galili rama mi lianhote tâna zâna ruai a ṭheh laiin hun remchâng a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Herodi fanu ngei chu a lo lût a, a lâm a, Heroda leh a chaw kîlpuite chu a tilâwm ta a; tichuan, lal chuan hmeichhe naupang hnênah chuan, “I duh apiang mi dîl rawh, ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Eng pawh mi dîl apiang chu, ka ram chanve hial pawh ka pe ang che,” tiin a hnênah chhia a chham bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a chhuak a, a nu hnênah chuan, “Eng nge ka dîl ang?” a va ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Baptistu Johana lû le,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chu hmanhmawh takin lal hnênah chuan a va lût ta nghâl a, “Thlêngin Baptistu Johana lû i mi pêk nghâl ka duh a ni,” tiin a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a lungngai ta êm êm mai a; nimahsela, a chhechhamte leh a chaw kîlpuite avâng chuan a lo hnial duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan a vêngtu sipai pakhat a tîr ta nghâl a, a lû rawn lâk tûr thu a pe a. Tin, ani chuan tân inah chuan a lû a va tan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a lû chu thlêngin a rawn la a, hmeichhe naupang hnênah chuan a pe a; tin, hmeichhe naupang chuan a nu hnênah a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte chuan an hriat veleh a ruang chu an va hlâwm a, thlânah an zalh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte chu Isua hnênah an rawn inkhâwm a, engkim, an thiltih apiang leh an zirtîr apiang an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nangmahniho ngawtin thlalêr hmunah a hrangin lo kal ula, châwl rih rawh u,” a ti a. (Mi tam tak an insûl zut zut a, chaw takngial pawh an ei hman si lo va.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, thlalêr hmun panin lawngin an va kal hrang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, miten an kal lai chu an hmu a, mi tam takin anmahni chu an hria a, khaw tin ata chutah chuan kein an tlân khâwm a, an lo lehkhalh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu vaukama a chhuah chuan mipui tam tak a hmu a, vêngtu nei lo berâmte ang an nih avângin a khawngaih ta êm êm a, thu tam tak a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, khua chu a lo tlai ta hle a, zirtîrte chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Hei hi thlalêr hmun a ni a, khua pawh a tlai tawh si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />anniho hi kan kiang vêl lovah leh khuaahte kalin, an ei tûr eng emaw tal an lei theih nân kaltîr ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “Nangmahnin ei tûr pe rawh u,” tiin a chhâng a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Chhang duli zahnih man va leiin ei tûr kan pe em ni ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Chhângpêr eng zât nge in neih, han en teh u,” a ti a. Tin, an neih chin an hriat veleh, “Panga, sangha pahnih nên,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an vaiin hlobet hring chungah chuan, a pâwl zêla ṭhuttîr tûrin an hnênah thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a tlarin za te, sawmnga te zêlin an ṭhu ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan chhangpêr panga leh sangha pahnih chu a la a, vân lam enin mal a sâwm a, chhangpêrte chu a phel a, an hmaa hlui tûrin a zirtîrte hnênah chuan a pe a; sangha pahnih pawh chu mi zawng zawng zîngah a sem bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, an vaiin an ei a, an puar ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, chhang nawi leh sangha nawite chu bâwmrâng sâwm leh pahnih an rût khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chhangpêr eitute chu patling hlîr pawh sângnga an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, amah ngeiin mipui chu a ṭîntîr vêl chhûngin, râl lehlama Bethsaida khuaa lo kal hmasa tûrin a zirtîrte chu lawngah a chuan luihtîr ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, anni chu a ṭîntîr hnu chuan ṭawngṭai tûrin tlângah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, khua a lo tlai lamin, lawng chu dîl lai takah chuan a lo awm a, ani chu amah chauhvin khawmualah chuan a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, an lawng karah chuan an mangangin a hmu a (thliin a ni lo lamah a nem si a) khawfîng chah dâwn lai vêlin dîl chungah kea kalin an lam a rawn pan a; anmahni kal pelh a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chuan amah chu dîl chunga kea a kal an han hmuh chuan hmuithla emaw an ti a, an au ta vak mai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />an vaiin amah an hmu a, an thlaphâng hle a. Nimahsela, ani chuan anmahni a be ta nghâl a, an hnênah, “Thlamuang takin awm rawh u; keimah ka ni alâwm, hlau suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, lawngah chuan an hnênah a chuang chho ve ta a, thli chu a bâng ta mai a. Tin, mak an tirilru hle a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />chhang thu chu a ngaihna an hrethiam si lo va, an thinlung a sak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, râl lehlam an kai chuan Gennesaret ram khawmual an thleng a, vaukamah chuan lawng chu an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, lawng ata an chhuah hnu chuan miten ani chu an lo hre ta nghâl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />chumi ram vêl zawng zawngah chuan an tlân ta sup sup a, a awm tih an hriatna apiangah, damlote an âwngphaha mu chungin an zâwn vêl ta ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, khaw têah te, khaw lianah te, lovah te, khawiah pawh a luhna apiangah damlote chu dâwr hmunahte an muttîr hlawm a, a puan hmâwr tal deh theih an dîl chiam a; tin, amah dek apiang chu an dam ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite leh lehkhaziaktute zînga mi tute emaw, Jerusalem khua aṭanga lo kalte chu a hnênah an rawn inkhâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chûnghote chuan a zirtîr ṭhenkhatin kut bawlhhlawha chhang an ei an lo hmu tawh a (“Bawlhhlawh” tih hi “sil loh” tihna a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Pharisaite leh Juda-ho zawng zawng chuan upate thurochhiah chu an pawm tlat avângin, an kut ngun taka an sil loh chuan an ei ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, dâwr hmun aṭanga an hâwn pawhin an inbual loh chuan an ei ngai lo. Tin, thu dang tam tak pawm tlat tûra an dawn chhâwnte chu a awm, no te, bêl te, dâr bêl te sil angte hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharisaite leh lehkhaziaktute chuan, “Engati nge i zirtîrten, upa thurochhiah ang zêla awm lova, kut bawlhhlawhin chhang an ei ṭhin ni?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Isaia hian nangni mi vervêkte thu hi a lo hril lâwk dik zet mai, ‘He miteho hian an kâin mi chawimawi a, An thinlung erawh chuan mi hlat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, an zirtîrnaa mihring thupêkte an zirtîr avângin, an mi biak ṭhin hi a thlâwn mai a ni,’ tih ziak ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian thupêkte chu thlahthlamin mihring thurochhiah chu in vuan tlat a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah, “Nangmahni thurochhiahte chu in pawm theihna tûrin Pathian thupêkte in duh lo hi rem in hre zet mai e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosian, ‘I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh,’ ‘Tu pawh a nu emaw, a pa emaw sawi chhia apiang chu thi mawlh rawh se,’ a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan heti hian in ti ṭhîn, ‘Miin a nu emaw, a pa emaw hnênah, “I mi chhawrna tûr hi Korban a ni tawh,” a tih chuan (chu chu “Pathian hnêna pêk” tihna a ni a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a nu tân emaw, a pa tân emaw eng mah tihsak in phal tawh ṭhîn lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mi hnêna in thurochhiah pêk chhâwn hian Pathian thu hi in bawh bo ṭhîn a ni; chutiang thil chu tam tak in ti ṭhîn,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu a ko leh a, an hnênah, “In zain ka thu hi ngaithla ṭheuh ula, lo ngai thiam rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mihring pâwn lam ata a kawchhûnga lûta amah tibawlhhlawh thei eng mah a awm lo; mihring kawchhûng ata lo chhuakte chu mihring tibawlhhlawhtu a ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, mipuihote chu ina a luhsan hnuin, a zirtîrte chuan tehkhin thu chu amah an zâwt fiah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nangni pawh chuti êma hriatna nei lo in ni maw? Eng pawh pâwn lam ata mihring kawchhûnga lût apiang, a thinlung chhûnga lût lovin, a pum chhûnga lûta dailênnaa a chhuah zâwk avângin, amah chu a tibawlhhlawh thei lo tih in hre lâwm ni?” a ti a. (Chu chu ei tûr tinrêng ei a thiang a tihna a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin, “Mihring kawchhûng ata lo chhuak chuan, chu ngei chuan mihring a tibawlhhlawh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kawchhûnga mi, mihring thinlung aṭangte chuan ngaihtuahna sualte a lo chhuak si ṭhîn: inngaihna te, rûkrûkna te, tualthahna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />uirêna te, awhna te, sualna te, bumna te, hurna te, îtsîkna te, sawichhiatna te, chapona te, âtna te hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />chûng thil sual zawng zawng chu kawchhûng aṭangin a lo chhuak a, mihring chu a tibawlhhlawh ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, chuta ṭang chuan Tura leh Sidon bialah a kal ta a; tin, inah a lût a, tu ma hriat a duh lo va; nimahsela, a inthup thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmeichhe pakhat, fanu naupang tê, ramhuai bawlhhlawh pai nei chuan a chanchin a lo hria a, a ke bulah a va bawkkhup ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmeichhia chu Grik mi a ni a, pianna lamah chuan Suro-Phoiniki mi a ni a. Ani chuan a fanu kawchhûng ata ramhuai hnawt chhuak tûrin a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Fate chu lo puar hmasa rawh se; fate chhang lâksaka uite hnêna paih chu a mawi lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, nih zawng a ni a; nimahsela, dawhkân hnuaia uite pawhin fate chhang nawite chu an ei ṭhîn alâwm,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “I thusawi avâng chuan kal tawh le; ramhuai chu i fanu kawchhûng ata a chhuak tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a inah chuan a va hâwng a, a fa chu ramhuaiin lo chhuahsan tawh a, khuma mu a va hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Tura ram aṭangin a chhuak leh a, Sidon khua tlawhin Dekapoli ram kal tlang zêlin Galili dîl chu a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat, bengngawng, ṭawng pawh ṭawng fiah thei lo hi a hnênah an rawn hruai a, a chunga a kut nghat tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan mipui zîng ata amah chauh chu a hruai hrang a, a kut zungṭangte chuan a beng kuate a khawih a; tin, chil a chhâk a, a lei a dehsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tin, vân lam enin a thaw huai a, a hnênah, “Ephatha,” a ti a. (Chu chu “Lo inhawng rawh” tihna a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, a bengte chu a lo inhawng a, a lei phuarna pawh chu a lo inphelh a, fiah takin a ṭawng thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah tu mah hrilh loh tûr a ti tlat a; nimahsela, a khap nasat poh leh an tlângaupui zual zâwk mah ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Ani chuan engkim ṭha takin a ti a; bengngawngte a tihvârsak a, ṭawngtheilote pawh a tiṭawng ṭhîn,” an ti a, mak an ti nasa êm êm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng nîahte chuan mipui tam tak an lo awm leh a, ei tûr eng mah an neih loh lai chuan ani chuan a zirtîrte chu a ko va, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipuiho hi tûnah ni thum ka hnênah an awm tawh a, ei tûr eng mah an neih loh avângin ka khawngaih êm êm a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chaw ngheia an ina ka hâwntîr chuan kawng lakah an chau dâwn si a; ṭhenkhatte phei chu an lo kalna a hla hle si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte chuan, “Miin he thlalêrah hian khawia chhangin nge hêngho hi an tihtlai theih ang?” tiin amah an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Chhangpêr eng zât nge in neih?” tiin anni chu a zâwt a. Tin, anni chuan, “Pêr sarih,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho chu leia ṭhu tûrin thu a pe a; tin, chhangpêr pasarih chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin a phel a, an hmaa hlui tûrin a zirtîrte hnênah a pe a; tin, mipuihote hmaah chuan an hlui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nghate tlêm tê an nei bawk a; tin, ani chuan mal a sâwmsak a, chûngte pawh chu an hmaa hlui tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, an ei a, an puar ta hlawm a; an ei bâng nawi pawh chu bâwm sarih an rût khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anni chu sângli lai an ni a; tin, ani chuan anni chu a ṭîntîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a zirtîrte hnênah lawngah chuan a chuang ta nghâl a, Dalmanutha ram chu a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite an lo chhuak a, amah fiah nân a lakah vân ata chhinchhiahna zawngin ani chu an hnial ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a rilruin nasa takin a rûm a, “Engati nge tûnlai chhuante hian chhinchhiahna an zawn? Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tûnlai chhuante hnênah hian chhinchhiahna rêng rêng pêk a ni lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, anni chu a kalsan a, lawngah chuan a chuang leh a, râl lehlamah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte chuan chhang an ken theihnghilh a, chhang tlang khat chauh lo chu lawngah chuan chhang dang rêng an nei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Pharisaite dawidim leh Heroda dawidim lakah chuan invêng ula, fîmkhur rawh u,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Chhang kan nei hauh lo,” tiin an inngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chu chu a lo hria a, an hnênah, “Engati nge chhang in neih loh avânga in inngaihtuah ni? Tûnah pawh in rilruin in la hre lo fo maw? A ngaihna pawh in la hre lo maw? In thinlung chu in tisak ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mit nei siin in hmu lo vem ni? Beng nei siin in hre lo vem ni? In hre reng lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sângnga zînga chhangpêr panga ka phel lai khân a nawi kha bâwmrâng eng zât nge in ruh khah?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Sâwm leh pahnih,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tin, sângli zînga pasarih ka phel lai khân, a nawi kha bâwm eng zât nge in ruh khah?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Bâwm sarih,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tûnah pawh a ngaihna in la hre lo fo maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Bethsaida khua chu an lo thleng a. Tin, a hnênah mitdel an rawn hruai a, amah dek tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan mitdel kut chu a chelh a, khua ata a kai chhuak a; tin, a mitah chil a chhâk a, a chunga a kut a nghah zawhin, “Khua i hmu thei em?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a han dâk chhuak a, “Mihring ka hmu a, thing kal ang maiin ka hmu si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a mitah chuan a kut a nghat leh a; tin, ani chuan a en reng a, a lo dam ta mai a, engkim fiah takin a hmu thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Isua chuan, “Khuaah pawh hian lût suh ang che,” tiin a inah a hâwntîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Isua leh a zirtîrte chu an kal chhuak a, Philipa Kaisari khawperahte chuan an kal a; tin, kal pahin a zirtîrte hnênah, “Miten tu nge a ni mi tih?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “ ‘Baptistu Johana a ni,’ an ti chia; mi dangin ‘Elija a ni,’ an ti chia; ṭhenkhat erawh chuan, ‘Zâwlnei tua emaw a ni,’ an ti che,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “A nih leh, nangnin tu nge a ni mi tih?” tiin a zâwt a. Petera chuan a hnênah, “Krista chu i ni,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a chanchin tu mah hrilh loh tûr a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Mihring Fapa chuan thil tam tak a tuar tûr te, upate, puithiam lalte, lehkhaziaktute duh loh va a awm tûr te, tihhluma a awm tûr te, ni thum china a thawhleh tûr te chu anmahni a zirtîr ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chûng thu chu chiang takin a sawi a ni. Tin, Petera chuan ani chu a hruai hrang a, a zilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani erawh chu a lehhawi a, a zirtîrte chu a en a, “Setan, ka hnungah kal rawh, Pathian thilte ngaihtuah lovin mihring thilte i ngaihtuah zâwk a nih hi,” tiin Petera chu a zilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho chu a zirtîrte nên a ko va, an hnênah, “Tu pawhin mi zui a duh chuan, mahni hrehawm pawisa lovin, a kraws puin mi zui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tu pawh a nun humhim duh apiangin a chân ang a; tu pawh keimah avâng leh Chanchin Ṭha avânga a nun chân apiangin a humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Miin khawvêl hi a pumin nei sela, a nun chân si sela, a tân eng nge sâwt ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Miin a nun aiah eng nge a pêk theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu pawh tûnlai chhuan uire leh thil tihsual hmangte zînga keimah leh ka thu zahpui apiang, Mihring Fapa hian, vântirhkoh thianghlimte nêna a Pa ropuinaa inthuama a lo kal hunah chuan, chu mi chu a rawn zahpui ve thung ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka ti a che u, heta dingho a ṭhente hi, Pathian ram, thiltihtheihna nêna lo thleng an hmuh hma loh chuan thihna tem tawp lo tûr an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ni ruk achinah chuan Isuan Petera te, Jakoba te, Johana te chu a hruai a, a hrangin tlâng sâng takah anmahni chauh a kal chhohpui a; an hmaah chuan a hmêl awmzia chu a lo danglam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, a silhfênte chu leia puan sutu rêng rêngin an sûk vâr theih loh khawp hiala vâr hlakin a lo tle ta sur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Elija leh Mosia chu an hnênah an rawn inlâr a, Isua nên an inbe ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Petera chuan Isua a bia a, “Rabbi, kan tân heta awm hi a ṭha e; bâwktê pathum kan khawh ang e, i tân pakhat, Mosia tân pakhat, Elija tân pakhat,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(An hlauh êm avângin sawi tûr ahleih pawh an hre si lo va.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, anmahni hliahin chhûm a lo zîng ta a; tin, chhûmah chuan aw a lo chhuak a, “Hei hi ka Fapa duh tak a ni, ama thu ngai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an han en vêl thuai a, anmahni hnêna Isua chauh lo chu tu mah an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, tlâng ata chu an chhuk laiin, Mihring Fapa mitthi zîng ata a thawhleh hnuah chauh lo chuan, an thil hmuhte chu tu mah hrilh loh tûr a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, chu thu chu an vawng reng a, “Mitthi zîng ata thawhleh chu eng tihna nge ni ang?” tiin an inzâwt ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, annin a hnênah, “Engtiziaa lehkhaziaktuten, ‘Elija a lo kal hmasa tûr a ni,’ ti nge an nih?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Elija chu a lo kal hmasa dâwn rêng a, engkim a siam ṭha dâwn a ni; thil tam tak tuarin mi hmuhsitin a awm tûr a ni tih, Mihring Fapa chanchin engtiziaa ziak nge an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Elija chu a lo kal tawh reng a ni; tin, a chanchin an ziak ang ngei khân, a chungah an duh duhin an ti tawh rêng bawk a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte hnên a zuk thlenin, an vêla mipui tam tak leh lehkhaziaktuten an lo hnial lai a zuk hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan amah an hmuh veleh chuan mak an ti hle a, a hnênah an tlân nghâl a, chibai an va bûk hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Anniho nên hian eng thûah nge in inhnial?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, mipui zînga mi pakhatin a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, ka fapa, ramhuai ṭawngtheilo pai chu i hnênah ka rawn hruai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a manna apiangah a titlu vak ṭhîn a; tichuan, a chilphuante a tla a, a hate a ṭhial a, a chêr telh telh ṭhîn a; tichuan, i zirtîrte hi hnawt chhuak tûrin ka ti a, an thei si lo va,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Chhuan rinna nei lote u, eng chen nge in hnêna ka awm anga, eng chen nge ka ngaihtheih ang che u? Amah chu ka hnênah rawn hruai rawh u,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, amah chu Isua hnênah an rawn hruai a; tin, ramhuai chuan ani chu a hmuh veleh naupang chu nasa takin a sawisa ta nghâl a; tichuan, leiah a tlu a, chilphuan tla zawih zawihin a tâl ta âwrh âwrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a pa hnênah, “Hetianga a lo awm ṭanna hi eng chen nge ni tawh?” tiin a zâwt a. Ani chuan, “A naupan lai ata tawh a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tichuan, amah tiboral tûrin vawi tam tak meiah te, tuiah te pawh a nam thlu tawh a; nimahsela, nangin eng emaw ti tala i tih theih chuan mi khawngaih la, mi pui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “I theih chuan â maw! Ringtu tân chuan engkim tih theih a ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, naupang pa chuan, “Ka ring e, ka rinhlelhnaah hian mi pui ang che,” tiin a au chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Isuan mipui lo tlân khâwm mêk a hmuhin ramhuai bawlhhlawh chu a hau va, a hnênah, “Nang ramhuai ṭawngtheilo leh bengngawng, thu ka pe a che, a chhûng ata lo chhuak la, lût leh tawh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, a au chhuak a, nasa taka a sawisak zawhin a lo chhuak ta a; tin, naupang chu thi ang maiin a lo awm ta a; chutichuan, mi tam zâwk chuan, “A thi a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a kut a chelh a, a kai tho va; tin, a lo tho ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu ina a va luh chuan a zirtîrten, “Engati nge keinin kan hnawh chhuah theih loh le?” tiin fianrialah an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hetiang hi ṭawngṭai chauh lo chuan engtin mah a chhuak thei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, chuta ta chu an kal chhuak a, Galili ram chu an kal tlang a, tu ma hriat a duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A zirtîrte hnênah, “Mihring Fapa hi mihringte kuta mantîrin a awm tûr a ni a, an tihlum bawk ang a; tin, an tihhlum hnu ni thum achinah a tho leh ang,” tiin a lo sawi tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, a thusawi chu a ngaihna an hre lo va, amah lah chu an zâwt ngam si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Kapernaum khua chu an lo thleng a; tin, in chhûngah chuan an awm laiin an hnênah, “Kawngah khân eng thûah nge in inhnial le?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela, kawngah chuan, “Kan zîngah tu nge ropui ber ang?” tia an lo inhnial tawh avângin an ngawi ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a ṭhu a, sâwm leh pahnihte chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Tu pawhin hmasa ber nih a duh chuan, mi zawng zawng aia hnuhnûng berah a awm tûr a ni a, mi zawng zawng rawngbâwltuah a awm bawk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, naupang tê a kai a, an zîngah a dintîr a; tin, a lo kuah a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Tu pawh ka hming avânga hetiang naupang tê pakhat pawh lâwm apiang chu, keimah mi lâwm an ni ang; tu pawh kei mi lâwm apiang chu, kei mi lâwm an ni lo vang a, mi tîrtu lâwm an ni zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Johana chuan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, tu emaw i hminga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak kan hmu a; min zui ve loh avângin kan khap ta asin le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “Khap tawh suh u; tu mah ka hminga thilmak ti sia mi sawi chhe nghâl thei an awm lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tu pawh min dodâl lo chu kan lama ṭang an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tu pawh Krista mi in nih avânga tui no khat in tûr pe apiang che u chu, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, a lâwmman tûr chu a chân tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tin, tu pawh hêng mi ringtu mi tête zînga pakhat pawh titlu apiang chu, an nghâwngah buh râwt sawmna lung lian pui awrhtîrin tuifinriatah thlâk sela, an tân a ṭha zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, i kutin a tihtlûk che chuan tan mai rawh; kut pahnih neia Gehenna-a mei mit thei lova kal ai chuan, piangsuala nunnaa luh i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, i kein a tihtlûk che chuan tan mai rawh; ke pahnih neia Gehenna-a paih ai chuan, kebaia nunnaa luh i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, i mitin a tihtlûk che chuan kher chhuak mai rawh; mit khing hnih neia Gehenna, an lung thih ngai lohna leh mei mih ngai lohnaa paih ai chuan, mit khing khat neia Pathian rama luh i tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mi tin meia alin an awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chi hi a ṭha e; nimahsela, chi pawh hi a dâk tawh chuan engin nge an tihal leh ang? Nangmahni ngeiah chi nei ula, inngeih rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, chuta ṭang chuan Judai ramah leh Jordan râlah a kal ta a; tin, mipuihote chu a hnênah an rawn inkhâwm leh a; tichuan, a tih dân pângngaiin a lo zirtîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pharisai ṭhenkhat a hnênah an lo kal a, amah fiah nân, “Miin nupui mâk a thiang em?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mosian engtin nge thu a pêk che u?” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Mosia chuan inmâkna lehkha ziakin mâk a phal ṭhîn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan an hnênah, “In thinlung khauh avângin asin chu thupêk chu a ziaksak che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, leilung pian tirh aṭang chuan, ‘Anni chu hmeichhia leh mipaah a siam a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan, ‘Mipain a nu leh a pa a kalsan ang a, a nupui a vuan ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tichuan, an pahnih chuan tisa pumkhat an lo ni tawh ang;’ chutichuan, pahnih an ni tawh lo va, tisa pumkhat an ni tawh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathianin a zawm tawh chu mihringin ṭhen suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, inah chuan a zirtîrte chuan chûng thu chu amah an zâwt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tu pawh a nupui maa mi dang nei apiang chuan a nupui chu a uiresan a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ani pawh chuan a pasal a ṭhen a, mi dang a neih chuan a uire a ni bawk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a deh atân a hnênah naupang tête an rawn hruai a; tin, zirtîrte chuan an lo hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan chu chu a hmuhin a lungni lo êm êm a, zirtîrteho hnênah chuan, “Naupang tête ka hnênah han kaltîr ula, hnar suh u; Pathian ram chu hetiang mite ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh Pathian ram chu naupang têin a lawm anga lâwm lo apiang, a chhûngah an lût tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, anmahni chu a lo kuah a, an chungah a kut nghatin mal a sâwmsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, kal tûra a chhuah laiin mi pakhat a lamah a lo tlân a, a hmaah a ṭhingthi a, a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu ṭha, chatuana nunna ka chan theih nân engtin nge ka tih ang?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Engati nge ṭha mi tih? Mi pakhat chauh lo chu tu mah ṭha an awm lo, chu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thupêkte chu i hria alâwm ‘Tual that suh,’ ‘Uire suh,’ ‘Ru suh,’ ‘Dâwtin hêk suh,’ ‘Bum suh,’ ‘I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh,’ tihte hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, chûng thu zawng zawng chu ka naupan têt ata ka zâwm ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isuan amah chu a en a, a hmangaih ta a, a hnênah, “Kawng khat i la bâk e; kal la, i neih apiang hralh la, pachhiate hnênah pe rawh; chutichuan, vânah ro i nei ang; tin, lo kal la, mi zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chûng thu chungah chuan a hmêl a lo dur ta khup a, lungngai takin a kal bo ta a; sum tam tak nei a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a en vêl a, a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Sum ngahte chu Pathian rama luh a va harsa dâwn êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte chuan a thusawi chu mak an ti hle a. Isua erawh chuan a chhâng leh a, an hnênah, “Naute u, sum ringte tân Pathian rama luh a va harsa ṭhîn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi hausa Pathian rama luh aiin, sanghâwngsei hriau benga luh tlang a awl zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan mak an ti nasa êm êm a, a hnênah, “A nih leh, tu nge chhandam ni thei ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a en a, “Chu chu mihring tân tih rual a ni lo va, Pathian tân erawh chuan tih rual loh a ni lo; Pathian nên chuan engkim tih theih a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Peteran a hnênah, “Ngai teh, keinin engkim kalsanin kan zui ta chia,” tiin a han sawi ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isua chuan, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh keimah avâng leh Chanchin Ṭha avânga in emaw, unaupate emaw, farnute emaw, nu emaw, pa emaw, fate emaw, ramte emaw kalsan tawh phawt chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tûn dam chhûng la la hian inte, unaupate, farnute, nute, fate, ramte a leh zain, tihduhdahnate nên hmu lo tûr tu mah an awm lo; hun lo la thleng tûra chatuana nunna nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi tam tak hmasa bera awmte chu hnuhnûng berah an la awm ang a, hnuhnûng berte pawh hmasa berah an la awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaa chho tûrin kawngah an awm a, Isua chuan an hma a hruai a; anni chuan mak an ti hle a; a rawn zuitute chuan an hlau va. Tin, ani chuan sâwm leh pahnihte chu a hruai hrang leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Ngai teh u, Jerusalem khuaah kan chhoh dâwn hi; Mihring Fapa hi puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute hnênah mantîrin a awm dâwn a ni; tin, anni chuan thi tûrin a chungah thu an titlu ang a, Jentail-te hnênah an pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan nuihza siam nân an hmang ang a, chil an chhâk ang a, an vua ang a, an tihlum ang; tin, ni thum chinah a tho leh ang,” tiin, a chunga thil lo thleng tûrte chu an hnênah a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh Johana chuan ani chu an rawn hnaih a, a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, i hnêna kan dîl tûr apiang che chu i mi tihsak kan duh e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “In tân eng nge tihsak che u ila in duh le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “I ropuinaah chuan, i ding lamah pakhat, i vei lamah pakhat min ṭhuttîr ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan an hnênah, “In dîl chu in hre lo a ni. Ka no in tûr chu in in thei em ni? Ka baptisma chan tûr pawh in chang thei em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Thei e,” an ti a. Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Ka no in tûr chu in in ang a, ka baptisma chan tûr pawh chu in chang ve ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />nimahsela, ka ding lamah emaw, ka vei lamah emawa ṭhut tûr thu chu keia pêk tûr a ni lo va, an buatsaihsakate tân a ni zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, sâwmte chuan chu chu an lo hriatin Jakoba leh Johana chungah chuan an lungni ta lo êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan anniho chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Jentail-te chunga rorêltua an ruatte chu an chungah an lal êm êm ṭhîn a, an mi liante chuan an chungah thu an nei êm êm bawk ṭhîn tih in hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni zîngah zawng chutiang a ni lo vang; tu pawh in zînga mi lian nih duh apiang chu in rawngbâwltuah a awm zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tu pawh in zînga hmasa ber nih duh apiang chu mi zawng zawng chhiahhlawhah a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mihring Fapa meuh pawh rawngbâwlsaka awm tûrin a lo kal lo va, rawngbâwl tûr leh mi tam tak tlan nâna a nun pe zâwk tûrin a lo kal a ni si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Jeriko khua an lo thleng a; tin, Isua chu Jeriko aṭang chuan a zirtîrte leh mipui tam tak nên a chhuah laiin, kut dawh mitdel, Timaia fapa Bartimaia chu kawng sîrah a lo ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Nazareth Isua a ni tih a hriat veleh, “Isu, Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, mi tam takin ngawi tûrin an hau va; nimahsela, ani chu, “Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au zual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a ding a, “Amah chu han ko teh u,” a ti a. Tin, mitdel chu an ko va, a hnênah chuan, “Thlamuang takin awm la, tho rawh; a ko va che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a puan a paih a, a zuang tho va, Isua hnênah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, Isuan amah chu a lo bia a, “I chungah engtia ka tih nge i duh?” a ti a. Tin, mitdel chuan a hnênah, “Rabboni, hmuh theih ka duh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Kal tawh rawh, i rinna hi i dampui a ni e,” a ti a. Tichuan, a hmu thei ta nghâl a, kalkawngah chuan Isua a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua an thlen dâwna, Olive tlânga Bethphage leh Bethani khaw kiang an thlenin, a zirtîrte zînga mi pahnih a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />an hnênah, “In hma zâwn khuaah sâwn va kal ta ula; tin, in luh tirhin sabengtungno thlun, tu ma la chuan ngai lohna in va hmu mai ang; chu chu phelh ula, han kai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, tu pawhin, ‘Kha kha engah nge in tih?’ an tih che u chuan, ‘Lalpan a duh a ni; hetah a rawn dahtîr leh thuai ang e,’ ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an kal ta a, kawtthlêrah kawngkhâr pâwn lama sabengtungno thlun an va hmu a; tin, chu chu an phelh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chuta ding tute emaw chuan an hnênah, “Sabengtungno kha engah nge in phelh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan Isua sawi ang tak khân an hnênah an sawi a; tichuan, an kal an phal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, sabengtungno chu Isua hnênah an rawn kai a, a chungah chuan an puante an phah a; tichuan, a chungah a chuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mi tam takin kalkawngah chuan an puan an phah a; mi dangin lova mi chhâwl sâtin an phah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a hma lama kalte leh a hnung lama rawn zuite chuan, “Hosanna! Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram lo thleng tûr, kan pa Davida ram chu chawimawiin awm rawh se. Chungnung berah khian Hosanna!” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaa Pathian biak inah chuan a va lût a; tin, engkim a en vêl zawh chuan tlai lam a lo ni ta a, a chhuak a, sâwm leh pahnihte nên Bethani-ah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan Bethani aṭanga a chhuah hnuin a ril a lo ṭâm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, theipui kûng hnah nei hla takah a han hmu a, “A rah ka hmu dah law maw,” tiin a va kal a; tin, a va thlen chuan a hnah chauh lo chu eng mah a hmu lo va, theipui rah hun a ni lo rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan thing chu a bia a, “Tûn achinah kumkhuain i lakah tu mân rah ei tawh suh se,” a ti a. A zirtîrte chuan chu chu an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua chu an thleng a, Pathian biak inah chuan a va lût a, biak ina englo zuartute leh leitute chu a hnawt chhuak ta a, tangka thlengtuho dawhkânte leh ṭhuro zuarho ṭhutphahte pawh chu a nam thlûksak bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, Pathian biak inah chuan tu mahin bungrua an ken tlang a phal ta lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan, “ ‘Ka in chu hnam tin tân ṭawngṭaina in an ti ang,’ tih ziak a ni lo vem ni? Nangni erawh chuan suamhmangte pûkah in siam zâwk hi,” tiin a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute chuan chu chu an hria a, amah an hlauh avângin a tihboralna tûrzia an zawng a; mipui zawng zawng chuan a zirtîrna chu mak an ti hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, tlai lam apiangah khawpui ata chu a kal chhuak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, zînga an kal pahin theipui kûng chu a zung thlenga thi zo vekin an hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Peteran a lo hre chhuak leh a, a hnênah chuan, “Rabbi, en teh, theipui kûng ânchhia i lawh kha a thi zo ta!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Pathian ring rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh he tlâng hnênah hian, ‘Lo insawn la, tuifinriatah lo inpaih rawh,’ tia, a rilrua ringhlel lova a sawi chu a lo thleng ngei ang tih ring apiangin an sawi ang apiang chu an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka ti a che u, engkim in ṭawngṭaia in dîl apiang chu hmu tawhah inngai ula; tichuan, in hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ṭawngṭaia in din hun apiangin, tu chungah pawh thupawi eng emaw in neih chuan ngaidam rawh u; in Pa vâna mi pawhin in bawhchhiatnate chu a ngaihdam theihna tûr che uin,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khua chu an thleng leh a; tin, Pathian biak ina a lên laiin puithiam lalho te, lehkhaziaktuho te, upaho te chu a hnênah an lo kal a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a hnênah chuan, “Tu thuin nge hêng thil hi i tih? Hêng thil hi ti tûrin tuin nge thu pe che?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Kei pawhin thu kam khat ka zâwt ve ang che u; mi chhâng ula; tichuan, tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Johana baptisma kha vâna mi thu nge, mihring thu? Mi chhâng rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, an inngaihtuah a, “ ‘Vâna mi thu,’ kan tih chuan, ‘Engah nge a thu in âwih loh le?’ min ti si ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Mihring thu,’ kan ti emaw chu ni ang?” an ti a. Nimahsela, mipui chu an hlau va; mi zawng zawngin Johana chu zâwlnei tak takah an ruat hlawm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua an chhâng a, “Kan hre lo,” an ti a. Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Kei pawhin tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh bîk lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, tehkhin thuin an hnênah a sawi ta a: “Tuin emaw grêp huan a siam a, palin a hung vêl a, grêp sâwrna tûr khur a lai a, in sâng a sa a, lo enkawltute hnênah thlawh hlawh tûrin a pe a, ram dangah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a lawh hun chuan huana rah chu a chan ai lo enkawltute hnên ata la tûrin lo enkawltute hnênah chuan bâwih pakhat a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chu an lo man a, an vêl a, kutruakin an kaltîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, bâwih dang an hnênah a tîr leh a; chu pawh chu lungin an dêng a, a lûah an lo tipem a, zahthlâk takin an lo sawisa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, bâwih dang a tîr leh pek a; chu mi chu an lo tihlum a. Bâwih dang tam tak pawh - ṭhenkhat an vêl a, ṭhenkhat an lo tihlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, pakhat, fapa duh tak a la nei a; ‘Ka fapa hi chu an zah ang,’ tiin ani chu a hnuhnûng berah an hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng lo enkawltute chuan, ‘He mi hi roluahtu tûr a ni; i that ang u khai! Tichuan, a roluah tûr hi kan ta a ni mai ang,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu an lo man a, an tihlum a, grêp huan ata chu an theh chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, huan neitupa chuan engtin nge a rawn tih ang? Lo enkawltute chu a rawn tiboral ang a, huan chu mi dangte a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He Pathian Lehkha thu hi in chhiar lâwm ni? ‘In satute lung duh loh kha, Chu ngei chu a kila lung ṭangkai ber a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chu Lalpa tih a ni a, Kan mit hmuhah a mak a ni,’ tih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, amah chu man an tum ta a; nimahsela, mipui chu an hlau va; chu tehkhin thu chu anmahni demin a sawi tih an hre si a. Tichuan, amah chu an kalsan a, an kal bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a thusawia man tûrin Pharisaite leh Heroda pâwla mi tute emaw a hnênah an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu an lo thlen chuan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, mi dik tak i ni a, pawisak chuan tu mah i nei lo tih kan hria, tu mah thlei bîk lovin, tihtak zetin Pathian kawng thu i zirtîr ṭhîn a ni: Kaisara hnêna chhiah chawi hi a thiang nge thiang lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan pe ang nge pe lo vang?” an ti a. Ani erawh chuan an vêrvêkzia chu hriain, an hnênah, “Engah nge mi fiah? Duli mi han lâk ula, ka lo en ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, an rawn la a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hei hi tu lem leh tu hming nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Kaisara,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Kaisara thilte chu Kaisara hnênah pe ula, Pathian thilte chu Pathian hnênah pe ta che u,” a ti a. Tichuan, mak an ti nasa êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Suddukaiho, thawhlehna a awm lo tite chu a hnênah an lo kal a; a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Zirtîrtu, Mosian, ‘Tu pawh a unaupain fa nei lovin a nupui thihsan sela, a unaupa chuan a nupui chu a rochungin a unaupa tân chi a thlahsak tûr a ni,’ tiin min ziaksak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw le, sal sarih an awm a; a upa berin nupui a nei a, chi thlah lovin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, a pahnihna chuan a rochung a, chi thlah lovin a thi leh bawk a; a pathumna chuan chutiang bawkin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, sal sarihte chu chi rêng rêng thlah lovin an thi zêl a. A hnuhnûng berah hmeichhia pawh chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thawhleh hunah chuan a tu bera nupui nge ni ang? An pasarih chuan nupuiah an nei ṭheuh si a,” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Hemi avâng hian a ni lâwm ni in ngaih sual ṭhin, Pathian Lehkha Thu leh Pathian thiltihtheihna in hriat loh avâng hian?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mitthi zîng ata an thawhlehin nupui pasal an innei dâwn tawh lo va, vâna vântirhkohte ang an ni dâwn tawh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, mitthite kaihthawha an awm tûr thu chu, Mosia lehkhabua hnim buk thûah khân, Pathianin, ‘Kei Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian ka ni,’ tia a biakzia kha in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chu mitthi Pathian a ni lo va, mi nung Pathian a ni zâwk; in ngai sual nasa hle a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktute zînga mi pakhat a lo kal a, an inhnial chu a lo ngaithla a, Isuan anniho chu ṭha takin a chhâng tih a hria a, a hnênah, “Thupêk zawng zawngah eng hi nge ropui ber?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan, “A ropui ber chu hei hi a ni: ‘Israel-hote u, ngai teh u, Lalpa kan Pathian chu Lalpa pakhat chauh a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian chu i thinlung zawng zawngin, i thlarau zawng zawngin, i rilru zawng zawngin, i chakna zawng zawngin i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A dawttu chu hei hi a ni: ‘Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte pawh i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi. Hêng aia thupêk ropui zâwk rêng rêng hi a awm lo,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktu chuan a hnênah, “A ni tak e, zirtîrtu, amah chu pakhat chauh a ni a, amah lo chu tu mah dang an awm lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />amah chu thinlung zawng zawnga, hriatna zawng zawnga, chakna zawng zawnga hmangaiha, mahni inhmangaih anga vêngte hmangaih hi pumhâl thilpêk leh inthawina zawng zawng aiin a ṭha zâwk êm êm tih hi i sawi dik zet mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, fing takin a chhâng tih Isuan a hriatin, a hnênah chuan, “Pathian ram i hlat lo ve,” a ti a. Chumi chinah chuan tu mân thu rêng rêng an zâwt ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Isuan Pathian biak inah chuan a zirtîr laiin anmahni a bia a, “Krista chu Davida fapa a ni tih lehkhaziaktuten engtiziaa sawi ṭhîn nge an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Davida ngeiin, Thlarau Thianghlimin, Lalpa chuan ka Lalpa hnênah, ‘I hmêlmate i ke nghahchhana ka siam hma loh zawng Ka ding lamah ṭhu rawh,’ a ti, a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Davida ngei chuan ani chu ‘Lalpa’ a ti si a, khawiah nge a fapa a nih ang?” a ti a. Tin, vântlângho chuan lâwm takin a thu an ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrnaah chuan, “Lehkhaziaktute lakah fîmkhur rawh u; anni chuan kawrfual haa lên an duh ṭhîn a, dâwr hmunah chibai bûk te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />inkhâwmna inah ṭhutphah ṭha ber te, ruaiṭhehnaah hmun ṭha ber te an ngiat ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />hmeithai sum an ei a, tlâng bum nân rei tak an ṭawngṭai ṭhîn; chûngho chuan thiam loh an chang nasa lehzual ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, thawhlâwm bâwm zâwnah chuan a ṭhu a, thawhlâwm bâwma mipuiho tangka thlâk dân chu a en a; mi hausa tam takin tam tak tak an thlâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, hmeithai rethei tê a lo kal a, dâr tangka dere pahnih a thlâk a (chu chu pawisa pakhat hu a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Isua chuan a zirtîrte chu a ko va, an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, thawhlâwm bâwma thlâktu zawng zawng ai hian he hmeithai rethei tê hian a thlâk tam zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hian an neih liama mi an thlâk a ni; ani erawh hi chuan a duh lai tak, a neih chhun tak, a intunnunna tûr zawng zawng chu a thlâk vek a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pathian biak in ata chu a kal chhuah laiin a zirtîrte zînga mi pakhatin a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, en teh, a lung leh a inte hi a ropui teh a nia!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Hêng in ropui tak hi i hmu maw? Tihchim loh va lung intiang rêng rêng hetah a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Olive tlânga Pathian biak in zâwna a ṭhut laiin Petera te, Jakoba te, Johana te, Andria te chuan a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Chûng chu eng tikah nge a lo awm ang? Chûng zawng zawng chu a thlen dâwn hunah chhinchhiahna eng nge awm ang, min hrilh rawh,” tiin an zâwt ru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tu mân an tihder loh nân che u fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tam tak, ‘Krista chu ka ni,’ tiin keima hming chhâlin an lo kal ang a, mi tam tak an tihder ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, indo thu leh indo thu thangte in hriat hunin mangang suh ang che u; chûng chu a lo thleng tûr rêng a ni; nimahsela, tâwpna chu a la ni rih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnam hrang leh hnam hrang an indo vang a, ram hrang leh ram hrang an indo vang a; hmun hrang hrangah lîrte a nghîng ang a, ṭâmte a tla ang; chûng chu nau vei ṭantirhna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, fîmkhur rawh u; rorêltute an mantîr dâwn che u a; inkhâwmna inahte an vua ang che u a; keimah avângin hotute leh lalte hmaah anmahni hriattîrna tûrin in la ding bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Chanchin Ṭha hi hnam zawng zawng hnêna hril hmasak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an hruai che ua, an mantîr hunah che u chuan, ‘Eng nge ka sawi ang?’ tiin ngaihtuah lâwk suh u; a hun takah chuan a hriattîr che u apiang, chu ngei chu sawi zâwk rawh u; a sawitu chu nangni in ni dâwn si lo va, Thlarau Thianghlim a ni zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, tihhlum tûrin unaupa leh unaupa an inmantîr ang a, pa pawhin a fa a mantîr bawk ang; fate pawhin an nu leh an pate an do vang a, an tihhlumtîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima hming avângin mi zawng zawng huat in ni ang; nimahsela, a tâwp thlenga tuar peih apiang, chu mi ngei chu chhandamin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, tiṭiautu tenawm chu a din lohna tûra ding in hmuh hunah (a chhiar apiangin a awmzia hre rawh se), chumi hunah chuan Judai rama awmte chu tlângahte tlân bo rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, in chunga awm chu chhuk suh se, a ina englo chuh tûrin lût hek suh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, lova awm chu a puan chuh tûrin kîr leh suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng ni chuan raite leh nau no pawmte chung chu a pik ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chûng chu thlasika a lo thlen loh nân ṭawngṭai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng ni chu hrehawmna ni a ni dâwn si a, chutianga nasa rêng rêng chu, Pathian siam leilung pian tirh ata tûn thlengin a la awm ngai lo va, eng tikah mah a awm leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan chûng nite chu titawi suh sela, mihring rêng rêng damin an chhuak lo vang; nimahsela, mi thlan, a ruatate avâng chuan nite chu a titawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chutih hunah chuan tu pawhin in hnênah, ‘En teh u! Krista chu heta hi a awm,’ emaw, ‘En teh u, sawta saw!’ emaw an tih chuan âwih suh ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Krista derte leh zâwlnei derte an lo chhuak dâwn si a, chûng chuan chhinchhiahna leh thilmakte an ti ang, thei ang sela, thlante meuh pawh an tihder theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangni erawh chu fîmkhur rawh u, ngai teh u, engkim ka hrilh lâwk tawh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng nia, chûng hrehawmna hnuah chuan, nî tih thimin a awm ang a, thla a êng tawh lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />vân aṭangin arsite a lo tla ang a, vâna thiltihtheihna awmte chu tihnghîn a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Mihring Fapa hi, thiltihtheihna nasa tak leh ropuina nasa tak nên, chhûm zînga lo kal an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan vântirhkohte chu a tîr chhuak ang a, a thlante chu kâwlkil li ata - lei tâwp aṭanga vân tâwp thlengin - a lâwr khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, theipui kûngah hian a tehkhin thu zir rawh u: a ṭang a lo nova, a hnah a lo chawr chuan nipui a thaw dâwn tih in hre ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />chutiang bawkin nangni pawhin chûng chu a lo thleng in hmuh hun chuan, amah chu a lo hnai tawh a, kawngka bul ngeiah a awm tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, chûng zawng zawng chu a thlen hma loh zawng tûnlai chhuante hi an ral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lei leh vân a ral ang a, ka thu erawh chu a ral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi ni leh a dâr thu chu Pa chauh lo chuan tu mân, vâna vântirhkohte pawhin, Fapa pawhin an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Fîmkhur ula, inring renga awmin ṭawngṭai rawh u; a hun chu in hre si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mi, a in kalsana, a bâwihte chu thuneihtîra, an hnathawh tûr pe ṭheuhva, kawngkhâr vêngtu pawh inrin tûr thu pe zeta, ram hla taka zin ta daih ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, inring rengin awm rawh u; in neitupa lo haw hun tûr chu tlai lamah nge, zânah nge, ârkhuanah nge, zîngah nge a nih dâwn in hre si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />chuti lo chuan, a lo haw phutin, muhîlin a rawn hmu hlauh dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, in hnêna ka sawi hi mi zawng zawng hnêna sawi ka ni. Inring rengin awm rawh u,” a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni hnih chinah chuan Kalhlên Kût leh chhang dawidim telh loh kût a awm dâwn a; puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute chuan amah chu ngamthlêma mana, an tihhlum theihna tûrzia an zawng an zawng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nimahsela, “Kût chhûng chuan ni suh se; chuti lo chuan, vântlâng zîngah buaina a lo awm hlauh dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Bethani khuaa phâr Simona inah a awm laia chaw a kîl laiin, hmeichhe pakhat alabasta bâwma spiknard hriak rimtui to tak kengin a lo kal a, a bâwm chu a tikeh a, a lûah a leih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, ṭhenkhat chu an thinur ta hlawm a, “Eng atân nge hriak rimtui hi a tihboral mai mai ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />He hriak hi duli zathum aia tam zâwka hralha, mi retheite hnêna pêk theih a ni si a,” an ti a. Tichuan, a chungah chuan an phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “Eng mah tih suh u; engah nge in tihbuai ni? Ka chungah hian thil ṭha tak a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi retheite chu kumkhuaa in hnêna awm an ni a, in duh hun apiangah anni chu in khawngaih thei si a; kei erawh chu kumkhuaa in hnêna awm tûr ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tih theih tâwk a ti a ni; ka taksa hi phûm tûrin a lo hnawih lâwk a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, khawvêl zawng zawngah, khawiah pawh Chanchin Ṭha an hrilna apiangah, he hmeichhe thiltih pawh hi amah hriat rengna tûrin an sawi ve zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Juda Iskariota, sâwm leh pahnihte zînga mi pakhat khân, Isua chu an hnêna a mantîr theih nân puithiam lalte hnênah a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an hriat veleh an lâwm hle a, a hnênah tangka pêk an tiam ta a. Tichuan, a mantîrna tûrzia remchâng a zawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chhang dawidim telh loh ni, ni hmasa ber, Kalhlên Kûtna berâmno an talh ṭhinna nîah chuan a zirtîrten a hnênah, “Kalhlên kût chaw i ei theihna tûrin khawiah nge va buatsaih ila i duh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, a zirtîrte zînga mi pahnih a tîr a, an hnênah, “Khawpuiah va lût ula, chutah chuan mipa bêla tui puin a tâwk ang che u; amah chu zui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a luhna apiangah, chu in neitupa hnênah chuan, ‘Zirtîrtu chuan, “Ka zirtîrteho nên Kalhlên Kût chaw kan eina tûr, ka mikhual pindan chu khawiah nge?” a ti e,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, amah ngei chuan pindan chungnung zau tak, bungraw awm sa peih diam a entîr ang che u; chutah chuan kan tân buatsaih ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chu an chhuak ta a, khawpuiah chuan an va lût a, an hnêna a sawi ang takin an hmu a; tin, Kalhlên Kût chaw chu an buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, khua a lo tlai lam chuan ani chu sâwm leh pahnihte nên an va kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, an kîla an ei laiin Isuan, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, in zînga mi pakhat, ka hnêna ei ve ngei hian mi mantîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, an lungngai ta hle a, a mal malin a hnênah, “Keimah em ni?” an ti ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Sâwm leh pahnihte zînga mi pakhat, thlênga mi chiahpuitu hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi a chanchin an ziak ang tak khân a kal dâwn a ni; nimahsela, Mihring Fapa mantîrtu tûr mihring chung chu a pik e! Chu mihring chu piang suh sela a tân a ṭha zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, an ei laiin Isuan chhang a la a, mal a sâwmsak zawhin a phel a, an hnênah a pe a, “La rawh u; hei hi ka taksa a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, no a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin an hnênah a pe a; tichuan, an zain an in ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hei hi ka thisen, mi tam tak tâna chhuak tûr, thuthlunna chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Pathian rama a thar ka in ni a thlen hma loh zawng, grêp hrui raha mi ka in leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, hla an sak zawhin an chhuak a, Olive tlângah chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “In zain lungni lovin in la awm vek ang, ‘Berâm vêngtu chu ka vua ang a, berâmte chu an darh ang,’ tih ziak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka thawhleh hnuah Galili ramah in hmaah ka kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Petera erawh chuan a hnênah, “An zain lungni lovin awm mah sela, kei zawng ka awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, vawiinah, zânin la laah hian, âr vawi hnih a khuan hmain nangin vawi thum mi phat ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan nasa takin, “I thihnaah chuan thi ve dâwn mah ila, ka phat tawp lo vang che,” a ti chiam a. Tin, chutiang bawk chuan an ti ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Gethsemane an tih hmun chu an thleng a; tin, ani chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Ka ṭawngṭai chhûng zawng hetah hian lo ṭhu rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Petera te, Jakoba te, Johana te chu a hruai a, nasa takin a thlaphângin a lo mangang ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tichuan, an hnênah, “Ka rilru a lungngai êm êm a, thihna khawp hial a ni; hetah hian awm ula, inring reng rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, tlêmin hma lamah a va kal hlek a, leiah a bawkkhup a, theih ni sela, chumi hun chuan amah pêl tûrin a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Abba! (Ka Pa!) Engkim i ti thei a; he no hi ka hnên ata la sawn rawh; nimahsela, keia thu ni lovin, nangma thû thû ni zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a lo kal a, anniho chu muhîlin a rawn hmu a; tichuan, Petera hnênah, “Simon, i muhîl a ni maw? Dârkâr khat pawh inring rengin i awm thei lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thlêmnaa in luh loh nân inring rengin ṭawngṭai rawh u. Thlarau zawngin a peih a, tisa erawh chu a chak lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a va kal leh a, a thusawi ngai sawiin a ṭawngṭai leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a lo lêt leh chuan anniho chu muhîlin a rawn hmu leh a, an mut a chhuak hle si a, chhân ngaihna pawh an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, a lo kal vawi thumnaah chuan an hnênah, “Tûnah zawng muhîl ula, châwl tawh rawh u! A tâwk tawh e; a hun chu a lo thleng ta; ngai teh u, Mihring Fapa hi mi sualte kutah an mantîr dâwn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tho ula, i kal ang u; en teh u, mi mantîrtu tûr chu a lo hnaih tâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a la sawi lai mêkin Juda, sâwm leh pahnihte zînga mi pakhat chu, a lo thleng ta nghâl a, ama rual chuan puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute leh upate hnên ata mipuiho, khandaih leh talhtum kengin an lo thleng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, a mantîrtu tûr chuan, “Ka fawh apiang chu amah a ni ang; man ula, fel takin hruai bo ang che u,” tiin chhinchhiahna tûr a lo hrilh lâwk tawh diam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tichuan, a thlen veleh amah a va pan ta nghâl a, “Rabbi!” tiin a fâwp ta ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, ani chu an chelh a, an man ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, a kianga dingte zînga mi tuin emaw a khandaih a phawi a, puithiam lalber bâwih chu a sât a, a beng a sah thlâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Isuan anniho chu a bia a, an hnênah, “Khandaihte, talhtumte kengin, suamhmang man tûr ang maiin mi man tûrin in lo chhuak a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Pathian biak inah ni tin zirtîrin in hnênah ka awm ṭhîn a, mi man si lo. Nimahsela, Pathian Lehkha thu chu a lo thlen theihna tûr a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, an zain amah chu an thlahthlam a, an tlân bo ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, tlangvâl tuin emaw, puan zai sîn chauh inbelin amah chu a zui a; tin, ani chu an lo man a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />nimahsela, a puan zai sîn chu a kalsan a, saruakin a tlân bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu puithiam lalber hnênah an hruai a; tin, ama rual chuan puithiam lalte, upate, lehkhaziaktute zawng zawng an lo kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, Peteran hla tak aṭangin amah chu a zui a, puithiam lalber in hual chhûng kawtlai thlengin; tin, chhiahhlawhte zîngah mei lum aiin a ṭhu ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, Isua an tihhlum theihna tûrin, puithiam lalte leh rorêltuteho zawng zawng chuan amah hêkna an zawng a; an hmu si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Mi tam takin dâwtin an hêk a; nimahsela, an hêkna thu chu a inhmu thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, tute emaw an ding a, dâwtin an hêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“He mi hian, ‘He Pathian biak in kuta sak hi ka ṭhiat ang a, ni thum chhûngin biak in dang, kuta sak loh mi, ka sa ang,’ a tih kan hria,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Nimahsela, chuti pawh chuan an hêkna thu chu a inhmu thei chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber chu a laiah a ding chhuak a, Isua hnênah, “Eng mahin i chhâng lo maw? Hêng hian an hêkna che hi eng tizia nge ni?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Ani erawh chu a ngawi reng a, eng mahin a chhâng lo. Puithiam Lalber chuan a hnênah, “Krista, Engthâwla Fapa chu i ni em?” tiin a zâwt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Ni e; Mihring Fapa hi Thiltihtheihna ding lama ṭhua, vân chhûm zînga lo kal in la hmu dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tin puithiam lalber chuan a silhfênte a pawt thlêr a, “Hretu dang engah nge kan ngaih tawh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Pathian a sawichhiatzia in hre tawh a; engtin nge in ngaih?” a ti a. Tin, an zain ani chu thi tlâkah an ruat hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhenin amah chu chil an chhâk ta pang a, a hmai an tuam a, an hnek a, a hnênah, “Sawi rawh,” an ti a. Tin, chhiahhlawhte chuan an chelh pahin an bêng sawk sawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tin, Petera chu hnuai lama in hual chhûng kawtlaiah chuan a awm laiin, puithiam lalber rawngbâwltu nula zînga pakhat a lo kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Petera mei lum ai chu a hmu a, a en a, “Nang pawh hi Isua, Nazareth mi hnêna awm kha i nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “I thusawi chu ka hre hauh lo mai, a ngaihna rêng pawh ka hre hek lo,” tiin a pha a. Tin, sumhmunah chuan a va chhuak a; tichuan, âr a khuang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Tin, nula chuan a hmu a, a kianga dingte hnênah chuan, “He mi hi an zînga mi a ni,” a ti leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Nimahsela, a pha leh a. Tin, rei lo tê achinah a kianga dingte chuan Petera hnênah, “An zînga mi i ni ngei mai, Galili rama mi i ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Chu mihring in sawia chu ka hre lo,” tiin ânchhia inlawhin chhia a chham ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Tin, âr khuan vawi hnihna chu a khuang ta nghâl a. Tin, Petera chuan, Isuan a hnêna, “Ar vawi hnih a khuan hmain nangin vawi thum mi phat ang,” a tih thu kha a lo hre chhuak leh ta a. Tin, chu chu a ngaihtuahin a ṭap ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, zîng a lo nih veleh, puithiamte chu upate leh lehkhaziaktute leh rorêltuho zawng zawng nên an inrâwn a, Isua chu an phuar a, an hruai a, Pilata hnênah an pe ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pilata chuan a hnênah, “Juda-te lal i ni em?” tiin a zâwt a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ni e,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte chuan kawng tam takin an hêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan a zâwt leh a, a hnênah, “Eng mahin i chhâng lo maw? Ngai rawh, an hêkna che zozai hi!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan eng mahin a chhâng ta lo va; chutichuan, Pilata chuan mak a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Pilata chuan kût nîah mi tâng pakhat an ngen apiang a chhuahsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat Barabba an tih chu helte zîngah phuarin a lum reng a, chûng chuan helnaah chuan tual an that a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mipuiho chu an han chho va, an tân a tihsak ṭhin anga ti tûrin an ngên ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Juda-te lal hi chhuahsak che u ila in duh em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Puithiam lalten îtsîkna avângin an rawn hruai tih a hre si a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, puithiam lalte chuan mipuiho chu Barabba chhuahsak zâwk dîl tûrin an fuihpawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilata chuan an hnênah, “Juda-te lal in tiha hi engtin nge ka tih tâk ang le?” tiin a chhâng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, anniho chu, “Kraws-ah khêngbet rawh,” tiin an au leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pilata chuan an hnênah, “Engah maw? Eng nge a tihsual ni?” a ti a. Nimahsela, anniho chu, “Kraws-ah khêngbet rawh,” tiin an au chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilata chuan mipuiho chu tihlungawi a duh a, Barabba chu a chhuahsak ta a; tin, Isua chu a vuak zawhin kraws-a khenbeh tûrin a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, sipaite chuan in hual chhûng kawtlai, Praitorian an tihah chuan amah chu an hruai lût a, an pâwla mi zawng zawng an ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, puan sen duk an sintîr a, hlîng lukhum an phiar a, an khumtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, “Chibai, Juda-te lal!” tiin chibai an bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a lûah chuan luangin an vua a, chil an chhâk a, ṭhingṭhiin chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, nuihza siam nân an hman zawhin puan sen duk chu an hlîp a, ama puan an sintîr leh a, kraws-a khenbeh tûrin an hruai chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, mi veivâk pakhat, ram lam ata lo kal, a kraws pu tûrin an man a - Simona, Kurini khuaa mi, Aleksandra leh Rufa pa chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Golgotha hmunah an hruai a (chu chu ‘Lu ruh hmun’ tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, uain, murra nêna pawlh an pe a; nimahsela, a la duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, kraws-ah an khêngbet a, an chan ṭheuh tûr hriat nân ṭhum vâwrin a silhfênte chu an insem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Isua an khenbeh chu fehrehsân lai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a hêkna lehkha a chung lamah an ziak a, “JUDA-TE LAL” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ama rual chuan suamhmang pahnih an khêngbet ve a; a ding lamah pakhat, a vei lamah pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, mi vei apiangte chuan an lû thingin, “Ehei! Nang Pathian biak in ṭhiata ni thuma sa lehtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />intidam la, kraws ata kha lo chhuk ta che,” tiin an tiel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin puithiam lalte chuan, lehkhaziaktute nên anmahni zîngah tielin, “Mi dang mah a tidam ṭhîn a, mahni a intidam thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kan hmuha kan rin theih nân, Krista, Israel lal chu, tûnah hian kraws ata chu lo chhuk ang hmiang,” an ti a. Tin, ama ruala khenbeh vete chuan ani chu an hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chawfâk hun a lo nih chuan, behliang mun hun thlengin khawvêl a lo thim ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, behliang mun hun lai chuan Isua chu aw ring takin, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakthani?” tiin a au chhuak a (chu chu “Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, engah nge mi kalsan?” tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, a kianga ding ṭhenkhatte chuan chu chu an hriatin, “Ngai teh u, Elija a ko a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat a tlân a, sponj uain thûra chiah khatin, tiangah a târ a, a han intîr a, “Awm rawh se, amah la thla tûrin Elija a lo kal emaw i en ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu aw ring takin a au va, a thlarau a thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Pathian biak in puanzâr chu, a chung lam aṭangin a hnuai lam thlengin a lo thlêr chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a hma zâwna sipai za hotu ding chuan a thlarau chutianga a thlah a hmuh chuan, “He mi hi Pathian Fapa a ni ngei mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhiate pawh hla taka thlîrin an awm a; chûng zîngah chuan Mari Magdalini te, Mari, Jakoba te leh Josea nu te, Salomi te an tel a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />(chûng chu Galili rama a awm laia amah zuia a rawng bâwlsak ṭhînte chu an ni) hmeichhe dang tam tak, Jerusalem khuaa ama ruala chho vete chu an tel bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, khua a lo tlai lam chuan Inrinni a nih avângin (chu chu Chawlhni hmaa ni hi a ni)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Josefa, Arimathai khuaa mi, rorêltu zahawm, Pathian ram beisei mi ve bawk chu a lo kal a, huai takin Pilata hnênah a lût a, Isua ruang chu a dîl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilata chuan chutia a thi ta thuai chu mak a ti hle a, sipai za hotu chu kovin, a thihna a rei tawh em tih a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotu kâ aṭanga a hriat chuan, a ruang chu Josefa hnênah a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Josefa chuan puan zai sîn a lei a, amah chu a la thla a, puan zai sîn chuan a tuam a, thlân, lung ker kuakah a zalh a, thlân kawngkaah chuan lung a lum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Mari Magdalini leh Josea nu Mari chuan an zalhna chu an hmu reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhni chu a lo ral chuan Mari Magdalini te; Mari, Jakoba nu te; Salomi te chuan amah hnawih tûra an va kal theih nân englo rimtui an lei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ni sarih ni hmasa berah, zîng takah, ni chhuah hnuin thlân chu an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, “Thlân kawngka ata lung chu tuin nge min lum sawnsak ang aw?” an tih lai mêkin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an han dâk a, lung chu lum sawn sain an hmu ta a, a lian hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, thlân chhûngah chuan an lût a, tlangvâl pakhat puan vâr sin, ding lampanga ṭhu an hmu a; an mangang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mangang suh u; Isua, Nazareth mi an khenbeh kha in zawng a ni âwm a, a tho leh ta; hetah a awm tawh lo; en teh u, an zalhna hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, kal ula, a zirtîrte leh Petera hnênah chuan, ‘Galili ramah in hmaah a kal dâwn a; in hnêna a sawi ang ngei khân chutah chuan in hmu ang,’ tiin hrilh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, an lo khurha, an lo mangan tâk avângin an chhuak a, thlân aṭang chuan an tlân ta vang vang a; an hlauh avângin tu ma hnênah eng mah an sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ni sarih ni hmasa ber zînga a thawhleh chuan Mari Magdalini, a kawchhûng ata ramhuai pasarih a hnawh chhuaha hnênah khân a inlâr hmasa ber a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chu Isua awmpui ṭhinte hnênah a va kal a, mitthi ngaia an ṭap lai chu a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chuan a nung leh a, hmuh pawh a hmu tih an hre na a, an âwih si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan an zînga mi pahnih ram lam pana an kal laiin, hmêl danglam puin an hnênah a inlâr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan zirtîr dangte an va hrilh a, anni thu pawh chu an âwih chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnu lehah chuan, chaw an kîl laiin sâwm leh pakhatte hnên ngeiah a inlâr a, a thawhleh hnua a hmutute thu chu an âwih loh avângin, an rin loh leh an thinlung sak kawngah chuan a zilhhau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Khawvêl zawng zawngah kal ula, thilsiam zawng zawng hnênah chuan Chanchin Ṭha hi hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ringa baptisma chang chu chhandamin an awm ang a; a ring lo erawh chu thiam loh changin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, hêng chhinchhiahnate hian ringtute chu a zui zêl ang: Ka hmingin ramhuaite an hnawt chhuak ang a; ṭawng thartein an ṭawng ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />rûlte kutin an la ang a; thihna tûr eng pawh in mah sela eng mah an ti lo vang a; damlote chungah an kut an nghat ang a, an dam zêl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Isua chu, an hnêna thu a sawi zawh chuan vâna hruai chhohvin a awm a. Pathian ding lamah a han ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu an kal chhuak a, ram tinah thu an hril ta a, Lalpan anmahni a thawhpui a, a zuitu chhinchhiahnate chuan thu chu a tinghet zêl a. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
